B.Iq=s(["The center square deserves its own spotlight. It's a single square, and all 24 squares of the innermost ring touch it \u2014 a piece standing on the pole has 24 destinations, exactly as you see below.","It has no color of its own, which is what lets an Arc or Omni switch colors there. Every long straight or diagonal move passes through it when it's empty; when it's occupied, it blocks like any other square."],t.s)
