B.IL=s(["Each side fields twenty pieces: one Prime, one Omni, two each of Arc, Radial, and Vector, and twelve Clones.","Your army starts filling the outer two rings on your side of the board. Your opponent's mirrors it exactly, straight across the pole.","Everything from ring C inward starts empty. The open middle of the board is most of the game \u2014 the next several pages cover what each piece does with it."],t.s)
