B.IO=s(["Get a Clone to your opponent's side of the board and you can trade it in \u2014 for a piece of yours that your opponent has previously captured. Not theirs; only your own losses come back this way.","This Clone is one step from the zone, and an Omni is already waiting in reserve from an earlier capture. Move it forward and choose."],t.s)
