B.IR=s(['Near the center, the Vector\'s jump has one exception. When its two-space run lands exactly on the pole, "one space to the side" means a quarter turn of the whole board \u2014 six wedges \u2014 instead of one.',"From here, the two squares closest to the pole among the highlighted destinations are that special quarter-turn landing. Everything else is the Vector's ordinary jump shapes."],t.s)
